{
  "slug": "lavita",
  "title": "lavita - companion",
  "description": "A LaVita animation that skips the typical explainer and follows the brand as a companion for the immune system and wellbeing through life.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "5d8b2656",
      "type": "hero",
      "media": {
        "kind": "video",
        "project": "lavita",
        "type": "header",
        "alt": "Animated LaVita character moving through a handcrafted world of cells"
      },
      "title": "LaVita **dared to stand** out in the german media landscape by commiting to the craft of animation.",
      "intro": [
        "\"Health is something you only notice when it's missing.\" But how do you communicate something so fundamental yet invisible?",
        "LaVita was looking for something different than the tenth explainer. I knew immediately I wanted to move beyond the typical problem/solution framework and instead explore how LaVita serves as a companion throughout life's journey, supporting the immune system and overall wellbeing.",
        "After weeks of collaborative ideation with the team, we developed a narrative following our protagonist Eva and her family through different life stages, enriched by an organic visual metaphor illustrating how LaVita nourishes the billions of cells in our bodies.",
        "During the concept phase, we crafted Eva's world and established a visual style designed to stand out in LaVita's competitive media landscape. What made this project exceptional was our client's commitment to craft and their deep understanding that details matter. This partnership allowed us to build every aspect of this world with care and intention."
      ],
      "credit": "Comissioned Work | LAVITA | 2025/26 | **Creative Direction & Artist**"
    },
